            <ArticleTitle>Acute abdomen due to endometriosis in a premenopausal woman taking tamoxifen.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>234-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Tamoxifen exhibits agonistic properties on the uterus. We describe a premenopausal woman who, while having tamoxifen due to a diagnosis of in situ ductal carcinoma, developed endometriosis requiring surgery.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
